    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not an end for you. It is a command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walk through worlds where gods have fallen silent, where civilizations lie in ruin, where life itself has turned to dust. You are a warrior\u2026 but not of flesh and blood. Your body is made of ash, your eyes see into the void, and your purpose is born of divine decree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that once haunted the living are now your resource. Defeating them is not the end\u2014it's the beginning. Bind their souls, summon their bodies, and turn fallen enemies into loyal soldiers. Every encounter is a new piece for your army. Every death holds potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.poster.avif?t=1754911313\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.webm?t=1754911313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.mp4?t=1754911313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necromancer\u2019s Last Stand</strong> is a dark fantasy action game forged with deadly, tactical soulslike combat. Each battle is a deadly dance where your reflexes, strategy, and decisions are pushed to their limits. Every fight you survive isn\u2019t just survival\u2014it\u2019s an opportunity to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal your enemies\u2019 abilities, evolve them, craft deadly combinations, and dominate the battlefield. Make an armored demon your frontline tank, or transform a cursed mage into a walking storm of destruction. The choice is yours. The strategy is yours. <strong>The army is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the ashes, you will forge a new order. As you carry out your god\u2019s final command, you will bring every shattered world to its knees\u2014and turn every war into a new beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a skeleton.<br>But what they should fear... is what marches behind you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not an end for you. It is a command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walk through worlds where gods have fallen silent, where civilizations lie in ruin, where life itself has turned to dust. You are a warrior\u2026 but not of flesh and blood. Your body is made of ash, your eyes see into the void, and your purpose is born of divine decree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that once haunted the living are now your resource. Defeating them is not the end\u2014it's the beginning. Bind their souls, summon their bodies, and turn fallen enemies into loyal soldiers. Every encounter is a new piece for your army. Every death holds potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.poster.avif?t=1754911313\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.webm?t=1754911313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705620/extras/07406f1d73240ee0f202cad46453650c.mp4?t=1754911313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necromancer\u2019s Last Stand</strong> is a dark fantasy action game forged with deadly, tactical soulslike combat. Each battle is a deadly dance where your reflexes, strategy, and decisions are pushed to their limits. Every fight you survive isn\u2019t just survival\u2014it\u2019s an opportunity to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal your enemies\u2019 abilities, evolve them, craft deadly combinations, and dominate the battlefield. Make an armored demon your frontline tank, or transform a cursed mage into a walking storm of destruction. The choice is yours. The strategy is yours. <strong>The army is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the ashes, you will forge a new order. As you carry out your god\u2019s final command, you will bring every shattered world to its knees\u2014and turn every war into a new beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a skeleton.<br>But what they should fear... is what marches behind you.</p>",
